Section: 1 Introduction
Text: 1 Introduction The top systems in recent machine translation evaluation campaigns on various language pairs use ensembles of a number of NMT systems (Bo- jar et al., 2016; Sennrich et al., 2016a; Chung et al., 2016; Neubig, 2016; Wu et al., 2016; Cromieres et al., 2016; Durrani et al., 2017). En- sembling (Dietterich, 2000; Hansen and Salamon, 1990) of neural networks is a simple yet very ef- fective technique to improve the accuracy of NMT.

